. 
. foreach v of varlist kidsex01-kidsex19 {
  2.     replace `v' = . if `v' < 0
  3. }
(1,468 real changes made, 1,468 to missing)
(2,685 real changes made, 2,685 to missing)
(4,831 real changes made, 4,831 to missing)
(5,596 real changes made, 5,596 to missing)
